     <P>各位老师：</P>
<P><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">绍兴市教育科学</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">年规划课题申报工作即将启动。本次课题申报我校可报综合课题<SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312">项<SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 2">，教改项目</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">8</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">项。请有意申报课题的老师准备好相关材料，于10月12日前送交教科室。具体通知及相关要求转发如下：</SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2"></SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2"></SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2"></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: center; FONT: 700 24px/48px "SimHei"; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px'>关于做好绍兴市教育科学2019年规划课题申报工作的通知</SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312">各区、县（市）教科所，在<SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 2">绍高校，市直学校：</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">绍兴市教育科学</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">年规划课题申报工作将于9月中旬启动，现将有关事项通知如下： </SPAN><SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt" align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">一、申报课题类别：</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN></B> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">此次申报的绍兴市教育科学研究的市级课题分为三类：</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">1．绍兴市高等教育研究课题（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">SGJ</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">—绍高教）</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">2．绍兴市基础教育综合课题（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">SJZ</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">—绍基综）（含市教育科研基地学校重点规划课题）</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">3．绍兴市基础教育学科教改项目（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">SJG</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">—绍教改）</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">绍兴市基础教育综合课题（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">SJZ</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">—绍基综）指向为学校管理、德育、教师专业发展、课程建设、教育教学评价、职业教育等方面的研究。绍兴市基础教育学科教改项目（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">SJG</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">—绍教改）</SPAN><B><U><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">必须围绕着课堂教学问题展开，指向各学科课堂教学改进的实证性研究。</SPAN></U></B><B><SPAN></SPAN></B> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt" align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">二、申报课题数额分配：</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN></B> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">1．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">SGJ</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">课题：绍兴文理学院</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">20</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">项，其它高校各</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">10</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">项。</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">2．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">SJZ</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">和</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">SJG</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 2">课题：各区、县（市）及市</SPAN>直校选送上限数（单位</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312">:</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312">项）</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
