<P align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">特殊教育<SPAN></SPAN></SPAN> </P></TD>
<TD style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1.5pt solid; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1.5pt solid" width=112>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">6</SPAN> </P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt" align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312">注：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312">、</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312">学科教改项<SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 2">目选题必须围绕着学科课堂教学问题；</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">、“幼教”教改项目直接上报至绍兴市幼教办。</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN></B> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt" align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">三、申报要求：</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN></B> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">课题“申报要求”见《绍兴市教育科研管理条例》（见绍兴市教育教学研究院网</SPAN><SPAN><A href="http://www.sxjky.com/"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2"><U><FONT color=#0066cc>http://www.sxjky.com</FONT></U></SPAN></A></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">）。</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt" align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">四、申报受理时间：</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">2018年</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">9</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">月</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">15</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">日～</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">10</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">月</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">15</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">日。</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt" align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">五、申报程序：</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN></B> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">1．申报人填写“绍兴市教育科学</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">年规划课题立项申报表”（附件</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">）；绍兴市教育科研基地学校重点规划课题申报人填写“绍兴市教育科学</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">年重点规划课题立项申报表”（附件</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">）</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">2．初审。各区、县（市）教科规划办公室（高校科研处、市直学校教科室）对《立项申报表》及研究方案进行初审，择优签署意见、加盖公章后，按规定的申报数额将申报材料报送到绍兴市教育教学研究院（绍兴市新河弄</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">66</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">号，邮编</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">312000</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">）杨伯明老师处（联系电话：88909267）。</SPAN><U><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">要求将课题申报材料按类别（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">SGJ</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">SJZ</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">或</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">SJG</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">）整理好，并分别按要求（序号与整理顺序一致、所填信息与纸质稿上一致）打印好汇总表（附件</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">）</SPAN></U><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">。</SPAN><SPAN><A><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">汇总表须同时以</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">电子稿形式发送到sxjky2009@163.com</SPAN></A></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">。</SPAN><B><U><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">不接受个人报送</SPAN></U></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">，</SPAN><B><U><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">请以区、县（市）为单位，高校和</SPAN></U></B><B><U><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">市直学校以校为单位报送</SPAN></U></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">。</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt" align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">六、其它</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN></B> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">1．绍兴市教育科研基地学校重点规划课题从课题指南（附件</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">）所给方向中选择，每校可申报</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">个课题（不占各区、县、市课题名额）。申报时</SPAN><B><U><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">务请在申报表中注明申报编号</SPAN></U></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">（共有</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">个编号）。请各区、县（市）教科所（市直学校教科室）在汇总时将基地校重点规划课题单独列出整理。</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">2．高等教育研究课题由各高校科研处负责初审，基础教育研究课题由各区、县（市）教科所（市直学校教科室）负责初审。</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">3．受理申报期间，如需了解、咨询有关情况，请与所在各区、县（市）规划办及高校科研处、市直学校教科室联系，也可与绍兴市教育教学研究院教科研指导中心杨伯明老师（电话：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">88909267</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">）联系。</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">4．本通知及附件电子稿均可从我院网站下载（网址：</SPAN><SPAN><A href="http://www.sxjky.com/"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2"><U><FONT color=#0066cc>http://www.sxjky.com</FONT></U></SPAN></A></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2">，科研指导中心栏目）。</SPAN><SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 2"></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 32pt" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18px; FONT-FAMILY: FangSong_GB2312"><A class=ke-insertfile href="http://www.sxjky.com/images/uploadfiles/201808/20180817100117_3344.doc" target=_blank><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 2"><U><FONT color=#0066cc>附件</FONT></U></SPAN></A><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 2">(点击下载</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 2">)</SPAN></SPAN> </P>
    
